This folder (examples/worlds/stortorget/) is licensed differently from the rest of Construct.

Stortorget at Christmas was made from one photograph:

  "Stortorget in Gamla Stan, Stockholm, Sweden, 2022 December - 5" by Ximonic (Simo Räsänen)
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stortorget_in_Gamla_Stan,_Stockholm,_Sweden,_2022_December_-_5.jpg
  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)

The photograph is included unchanged as reference.jpg. The world was made to match it (its camera, its layout and
the critics' judgements follow the photograph), so everything in this folder is treated as an adaptation of it and
distributed under the same license: the world (world.json), its constructs (constructs/), its pictures and renders,
the record of its rounds (run/) and its page (README.md).

