Credit when reusing it: "Stortorget at Christmas, made with Construct by GPT-6.1 Sol, after a photograph by Ximonic
(Simo Räsänen), CC BY-SA 4.0." The buildings are real places; their names belong to them, and no endorsement is
implied. The rest of Construct, outside this folder, is under the Apache License 2.0 (see the LICENSE file at the
root of the repository).
